<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
	<title>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.</title>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, width=device-width">
	<link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://namu.wiki/favicon.ico">
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<head>
<style>
	body {
		font-family: "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
		font-weight: 300;
		word-break: keep-all;
	}
	a {
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.wrapper {
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
		margin-top: 100px;
		display: -ms-flexbox;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: row;
		justify-content: center;
	}
	.content {
		-ms-flex: 0 1 auto;
		flex: 0 1 auto;
		display: -ms-flexbox;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: row;
	}
	.left-icon {
		-ms-flex: 0 1 auto;
		flex: 0 1 auto;
		margin-right: 30px;
	}
	.main-content {
		-ms-flex: 0 1 auto;
		flex: 0 1 auto;
		display: -ms-flexbox;
		display: flex;
		-ms-flex-direction: column;
		flex-direction: column;
	}
	.error-title {
		font-size: 24px;
		margin-bottom: 32px;
	}
	.error-message {
		font-size: 14px;
		margin-bottom: 32px;
	}
	.error-detail {
		align-self: stretch;

		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
		margin-bottom: 32px;
		padding: 14px;
		font-size: 12px;
	}
	.error-buttons {
		display: -ms-flexbox;
		display: flex;
		-ms-flex-direction: row;
		flex-direction: row;
	}

	.previous-page-btn {
		margin-right: 10px;
	}
	.previous-page-btn {
		width: 100px;
		height: 30px;
		font-size: 16px;

		text-align: center;
		vertical-align: middle;
		user-select: none;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		border-radius: 2px;

		position: relative;
	}
	.previous-page-btn::before {
		content: "이전 페이지";
		line-height: 28px;
		position: absolute;
		left: 1px;
		top: 1px;
		width: calc(100% - 2px);
		height: calc(100% - 2px);
		background: white;
		border-radius: 1.5px;
	}
	.previous-page-btn::after {
		content: " ";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0px;
		top: 0px;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
	}
	.previous-page-btn, .previous-page-btn:hover {
		color: rgb(0, 164, 155);
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(0, 164, 155) 0%, rgb(34,178,114) 100%);
	}
	.previous-page-btn:hover::after {
		background: black;
		opacity: 0.1;
	}

	.namuwiki-home-btn {
		width: 100px;
		height: 30px;
		font-size: 16px;

		text-align: center;
		vertical-align: middle;
		user-select: none;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		border-radius: 2px;

		position: relative;
		line-height: 28px;
	}
	.namuwiki-home-btn::after {
		content: " ";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0px;
		top: 0px;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
	}
	.namuwiki-home-btn, .namuwiki-home-btn:hover {
		color: white;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(0, 164, 155) 0%, rgb(34,178,114) 100%);
	}
	.namuwiki-home-btn:hover::after {
		background: black;
		opacity: 0.1;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.content, .main-content {
			-ms-flex-direction: column;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
		}
		.left-icon {
			margin-right: 0;
			margin-bottom: 30px;
		}
		.error-title, .error-message {
			text-align: center;
		}
		.error-message {
			padding-left: 10px;
			padding-right: 10px;
		}
		.error-detail {
			margin-left: 10px;
			margin-right: 10px;
		}
		.error-buttons {
			-ms-flex-direction: column;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-self: stretch;
		}
		.previous-page-btn {
			width: 100%;
			height: 48px;
			margin-right: 0px;
			margin-bottom: 20px;
		}
		.previous-page-btn::before {
			line-height: 46px;
		}
		.namuwiki-home-btn {
			width: 100%;
			height: 48px;
			line-height: 46px;
		}
	}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
	<div class="content">
		<div class="left-icon">
			<img style="width: 160px; height: 120px" src="data:image/png;base64,">
		</div>
		<div class="main-content">
			<div>
			<img style="width: 120px; height: 72px" src="data:image/png;base64,">
			<img style="width: 120px; height: 72px" src="data:image/png;base64,">
			</div>
			<div class="error-title">페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.</div>
			<div class="error-message">페이지가 존재하지 않거나, 사용할 수 없는 페이지입니다.<br/>입력하신 주소가 정확한지 다시 한 번 확인해주세요.<br/></div>
			<div class="error-buttons">
				<a href="javascript:history.back();" class="previous-page-btn"></a>
				<a href="https://namu.wiki" class="namuwiki-home-btn">나무위키 홈</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
